  $( A trail between two vertices is a trail.  (Contributed by Alexander van
     der Vekens, 12-Dec-2017.)  (Revised by AV, 7-Jan-2021.) $)
  trlsonistrl $p |- ( F ( A ( TrailsOn ` G ) B ) P -> F ( Trails ` G ) P ) $=
