       Vekens, 2-Dec-2017.)  (Revised by AV, 15-Feb-2021.) $)
    df-conngr $a |- ConnGraph = { g | [. ( Vtx ` g ) / v ].
                 A. k e. v A. n e. v E. f E. p f ( k ( PathsOn ` g ) n ) p } $.

